{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-45","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Arbeit 4","bn":"কাজ ৪"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„gründen“ মানে কী?","options":["শেখানো","অনুভব করা","প্রতিষ্ঠা করা"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-45-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Sie möchte eine eigene Firma ___. (প্রতিষ্ঠা করা)","options":["gründen","entlassen","vorhersehen"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-45-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„sich bewerben“ মানে কী?","options":["প্রভাবিত করা","আবেদন করা","ফিরে আসা"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-45-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„beibringen“ মানে কী?","options":["গড়ে তোলা","ছুটি পাওয়া","শেখানো"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-45-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Mein Vater hat mir das Kochen ___. (শেখানো)","options":["beigebracht","gegründet","entlassen"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-45-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Firma hat zehn Mitarbeiter ___. (বরখাস্ত করা)","options":["beigebracht","entlassen","gegründet"],"answer":1,"explanation":"entlassen-এর Partizip II-ও entlassen।","id":"b1-practice-45-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„zurückkehren“ মানে কী?","options":["চলে যাওয়া","এগিয়ে যাওয়া","ফিরে আসা"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-45-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er hat den Chef mit seiner Idee ___. (প্রভাবিত করা)","options":["beeindruckt","ausgearbeitet","vermittelt"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-45-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Arbeit ist ___ anstrengend, aber sie macht Spaß.","options":["je","zwar","weder"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-45-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„zwar … aber“ মানে কী?","options":["ঠিকই … কিন্তু","যত … তত","হয় … নয়তো"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-45-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Je mehr Erfahrung du hast, ___ schneller findest du eine Stelle.","options":["dann","desto","als"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-45-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„erledigen“ মানে কী?","options":["নিয়োগ করা","সহ্য করা","সম্পন্ন করা"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-45-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„annehmen“ (চাকরির প্রস্তাব) মানে কী?","options":["গ্রহণ করা","বাতিল করা","আবেদন করা"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-45-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich habe die Stelle ___. Sie war nicht gut für mich. (বাতিল করা, পদত্যাগ)","options":["geleitet","gekündigt","angenommen"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-45-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Projekt, ___ mein Kollege leiten soll, ist sehr wichtig.","options":["der","dem","das"],"answer":2,"explanation":"das Projekt, Akkusativ → das।","id":"b1-practice-45-q15"}],"requires":{"grammar":27,"vocabulary":29}},"schema":1,"id":"b1-practice-45","level":"B1","test":[]}